    "enUS": {
      "description": "You've got that \"High Order\" look to you. Those with Highborne ancestry always seem to have a slight twinkle in their eyes that gives it away. Before I properly put you to work around here, you should check in with our resident High Order elder Rathiril Sunlance. You can find him here in the main lodge, just around the corner from me.\r\n\r\nOh, and check in with Coriella Calmbreeze as well, she runs the local inn and can provide lodging and supplies, should you need them.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Speak with Rathiril Sunlance",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
